OL,3,GNEWSAPool restoration group 'delighted'
OL,4,Aby new fund                            
OL,6,FA group working to restore its local   
OL,7,Foutdoor pool has said it is "delighted"
OL,8,Fby the government's announcement of a  
OL,9,Fnew fund for lidos.                    
OL,11,FTwenty MPs led a campaign calling for  
OL,12,Fthe government to help revive          
OL,13,Ffacilities across the country, with the
OL,14,Fmoney now pledged by the Department for
OL,15,FDigital, Culture, Media and Sport.     
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
