OL,3,GNEWSAPool restoration group 'delighted'
OL,4,Aby new fund                            
OL,6,FCounty Durham's only heated lido at    
OL,7,FStanhope in Weardale closed in 2023    
OL,8,Fafter a major electrical failure in its
OL,9,Fplant room and the Weardale Open Air   
OL,10,FSwimming Pool Refurbishment Project has
OL,11,Fbeen trying to raise enough money to   
OL,12,Freopen it.                             
OL,14,FGroup member Laura Alliston said of the
OL,15,Ffund: "We're really hopeful            
OL,16,Fcommunity-led restoration projects like
OL,17,Fours would be able to benefit."        
